# {{ site.name }}

> {{ site.description }}

NobodyWho is a library to runs large language models fully on-device, with support for Godot, Python, Flutter, React Native, Kotlin and Swift. No cloud, no server required.

## Main pages

- [Home]({{ site.url }}/): What NobodyWho is and the platforms it supports.
- [Apps]({{ site.url }}/apps/): Apps built by NobodyWho.
- [Model Selection]({{ site.url }}/models/): Recommended on-device models by size, device and capability.
- [Developers]({{ site.url }}/developers/): SDK install commands per platform, quickstarts, the data API and agent resources.
- [Starter Pack]({{ site.url }}/starter-pack/): Examples and starter projects for running AI locally.
- [About]({{ site.url }}/about/): The team and project milestones.
- [Blog]({{ site.url }}/posts/): News, tutorials and technical write-ups.

